<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Centigram raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Centigram raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany Corp said it raised Centigram Communications Corp to buy from neutral due to &quot;compelling valuation.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said Centrigram has little downside risk.</p>
<p>-- said believes company is serious about expense control, product enhancements and increasing shareholder value.</p>
<p>-- said year-end price target is $14 a share.</p>
<p>-- Centigram lost 1/8 to 10.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
